%% Sequence: client -> API -> server -> upstream -> verdict
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Android)
    participant A as API (Vercel /api/index.py)
    participant S as Server (routers)
    participant Y as yfinance / Kaggle
    participant R as Response
    participant V as Verdict Engine

    C->>A: GET /api/search?q=RELIANCE
    A->>S: route to search router
    S->>Y: fetch symbol list
    Y-->>S: symbols
    S-->>R: 200 [{symbol, name}]
    R-->>C: JSON list

    C->>A: GET /api/technicals?symbol=RELIANCE
    A->>S: route to technicals router
    S->>Y: fetch price history
    Y-->>S: OHLCV
    S->>V: indicators + patterns
    V-->>R: signals with provenance
    R-->>C: JSON payload

    C->>A: GET /api/decision?symbol=RELIANCE
    A->>S: route to decision router
    S->>Y: fundamentals + technicals
    Y-->>S: raw data
    S->>V: score
    V-->>R: verdict (BUY/HOLD/SELL, confidence)
    R-->>C: JSON verdict
